    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python file named `aggregate_metric_stats.py` that retrieves aggregated statistics for a metric over a time window using a concrete external provider. I will use the AWS CloudWatch service for this task, as it is a concrete external provider that offers the required functionality. I will import the necessary AWS SDK (Boto3) and use it to interact with CloudWatch. </thinking>\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789888329564,
          "start": 1789888326332
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bda86abc001YyPA3FJMlu68Fg",
