      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file 'query_metric_window.py', I need to include code that queries recent data points for a named metric over a time window using a concrete external provider. The provider must be identifiable in the code. I will use the AWS CloudWatch service for this task, as it is a concrete external provider that allows querying metrics over a specified time window. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
